# Semantic views are CREATE SEMANTIC VIEW DDL, not select statements — the model
# body starts at TABLES(...). sqlfluff's snowflake dialect cannot parse that
# grammar, so every model here fails with "unparsable section" no matter how it
# is formatted. Nothing to fix by reformatting, so the folder is excluded rather
# than carrying a noqa on every file.
#
# Snowflake itself is the parser that matters here: `dbt run` fails outright on a
# malformed clause, which is a stricter check than the linter was giving.
